# The person's own identifier. `identity_user.id` IS the subject, so classifying it non-person would be the
# most consequential false statement this file could carry. Its owner hard-deletes the row: the whole
# aggregate is the personal datum, so there is nothing left to scrub afterwards. It carries no
# `#[PersonSubjectReference]` because the property is declared in the shared `Identifiable` trait, and
# annotating it there would propagate the declaration to all eight entities that use it.
Erpify\Iam\Identity\Domain\Entity\User::$id => person :: src/Iam/Identity/Application/EraseIdentitySubject.php

